Apa?

41
00:04:50,207 --> 00:04:51,375
Tapi dia benar.

42
00:04:51,458 --> 00:04:54,920
Ya. Menyeramkan dan agak menyedihkan.

43
00:04:55,879 --> 00:04:56,880
